;
; How Caravan files a shipment in MYRA: its number, its carrier's number,
; its mass and charged weight in grams, its status (caravan_rules.h CR5)
; and when it last changed, in seconds since 1970. The rules say what the
; values may mean; this says whether they make a record.
^ZXCARAVAN(ship:i6) = carrier:i3! ^ mass:i9! ^ charged:i9! ^ status:i1! ^ stamp:i10!
